            "review_title": "Review at Blue Sky Restaurant Foods Smoothie",
            "review_text": "annaandfamily2016\nAlbury, Australia5 contributions\n0\nBest mango smoothies\nDec 2023 • Family\nThe best mango smoothies we've had this trip so far. So good we went for afternoon tea, dinner and then dinner once we returned from the loop tour!\nAte dinnerx2 here. Food was good, esp the spring rolls. It was a bit slow as there was only one person working in the cafe, he makes it freshly/one dish at a time and we ordered after a big group. But worth the wait, especially with a mango smoothie in hand!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2023",
